data: {"id": "41951bc6dd604424-thinking-parallel_evidence-1605", "run_id": "41951bc6dd604424", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我有了完整的证据链：\n\n**事实总结：**\n\n1. **Pod 状态确认**：`workload-68c557d875-bsq52` 仍处于 **Pending** 状态，22分钟，`READY=0/1`，无 IP，无节点分配。\n\n2. **调度事件**：持续触发 `FailedScheduling`，原因明确为 **\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"**。\n\n3. **Pod 调度约束**：Pod 的 `nodeSelector` 为 `{\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`。\n\n4. **节点状态**：集群共 3 个节点（master, node1, node2），全部 **Ready**，但**没有任何一个节点**带有 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签。\n\n5. **Metrics 确认**：`kube_pod_status_phase` 显示 phase=Pending 值为 1，其他 phas", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788761656980, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

