data: {"id": "41951bc6dd604424-final", "run_id": "41951bc6dd604424", "seq": 1610, "ts_ms": 1788761671666, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod workload-68c557d875-bsq52 处于 Pending 状态，持续 22 分钟未调度。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `pod.condition` | `PodScheduled=False`, `reason=Unschedulable`, `message=0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态的直接原因：调度器无法找到匹配节点。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `event.message` | `FailedScheduling`, `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` | 记录调度失败的 Warning 事件，确认亲和性/选择器匹配失败。 |\n| 3 | Metric | `kube_pod_status_phase` | `phase=Pending`, `value=1` | 验证 Pod 状态从监控维度确认未进入 Running 状态。 |\n\n上述 K8s 事件与状态事实互相印证，一致指向调度亲和性（Affinity/Selector）匹配失败，且 Metric 确认了该持续状态。因容器未启动，无 Logging/Tracing 证据，根因需依赖 K8s 配置事实与事件推断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 指定了 nodeSelector `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` → 集群 3 个节点均无该标签 → 调度器匹配 0/3 节点，触发 FailedScheduling → Pod 持续 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n- **已确认根因**：Pod 定义了 `nodeSelector`（`aiops.lab/unavailable=true`），但集群所有节点（master, node1, node2）均未配置该标签（事实 1, 2）。这导致调度器无法将 Pod 调度至任何节点，引发 `Pending` 状态。\n- **支持证据**：`FailedScheduling` 事件与 `Unschedulable` 条件明确指出了“未匹配亲和性/选择器”这一机制（证据 #1, #2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 29.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52: 38.3s (Evidence 30.4s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 6.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 74.89, "metrics": {"run_id": "41951bc6dd604424", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 74.90353298187256, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "57%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 74903.53298187256, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 70165.83442687988, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 10000.6422996521, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4447.8089809417725}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 29816.877841949463, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 38328.627586364746, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 6723.893642425537, "success": true}}, "success": true, "error